here are also a couple of scripts to backup and restore the MySQL database.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Useful pages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.docker.com/v1.5/compose/yml/"&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.docker.com/v1.5/compose/yml/"&gt;https://docs.docker.com/v1.5/compose/yml/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>